{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"JER","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"耶利米書","commonName":"耶利米書","title":"耶利米書","order":24,"numberOfChapters":52,"sha256":"863aa7b1543849e3cfd2c559a4715af74ecbeb9dde4c86853162816b04e9f732","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/JER/1.json","lastChapterNumber":52,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/JER/52.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1361},"chapter":{"number":51,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["再審判巴比倫"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["耶和華如此說：",{"text":"我必使毀滅的風颳起，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"攻擊巴比倫和住在立加米的人。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要打發外邦人來到巴比倫，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"簸揚她，使她的地空虛。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在她遭禍的日子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們要周圍攻擊她。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"拉弓的，要向拉弓的和貫甲挺身的射箭。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不要憐惜她的少年人；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要滅盡她的全軍。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們必在迦勒底人之地被殺仆倒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在巴比倫的街上被刺透。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列和猶大雖然境內充滿違背以色列聖者的罪，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"卻沒有被他的上帝－萬軍之耶和華丟棄。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"text":"你們要從巴比倫中逃奔，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"各救自己的性命！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不要陷在她的罪孽中一同滅亡；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為這是耶和華報仇的時候，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他必向巴比倫施行報應。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"巴比倫素來是耶和華手中的金杯，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使天下沉醉；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"萬國喝了她的酒就顛狂了。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"巴比倫忽然傾覆毀壞；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要為她哀號；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"為止她的疼痛，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"拿乳香或者可以治好。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我們想醫治巴比倫，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她卻沒有治好。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"離開她吧！我們各人歸回本國；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為她受的審判通於上天，達到穹蒼。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華已經彰顯我們的公義。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"來吧！我們可以在錫安","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"報告耶和華－我們上帝的作為。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"text":"你們要磨尖了箭頭，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"抓住盾牌。","poem":1},"耶和華定意攻擊巴比倫，將她毀滅，所以激動了米底亞君王的心；因這是耶和華報仇，就是為自己的殿報仇。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"text":"你們要豎立大旗，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"攻擊巴比倫的城牆；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要堅固瞭望臺，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"派定守望的設下埋伏；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為耶和華指着巴比倫居民所說的話、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所定的意，他已經作成。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"住在眾水之上多有財寶的啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的結局到了！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你貪婪之量滿了！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"萬軍之耶和華指着自己起誓說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必使敵人充滿你，像螞蚱一樣；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們必吶喊攻擊你。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["頌讚上帝的詩歌"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"text":"耶和華用能力創造大地，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用智慧建立世界，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用聰明鋪張穹蒼。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他一發聲，空中便有多水激動；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他使雲霧從地極上騰。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他造電隨雨而閃，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"從他府庫中帶出風來。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"各人都成了畜類，毫無知識。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"各銀匠都因他的偶像羞愧；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他所鑄的偶像本是虛假的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"其中並無氣息，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"都是虛無的，是迷惑人的工作，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"到追討的時候，必被除滅。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"雅各的分不像這些，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因他是造作萬有的主；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列也是他產業的支派。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"萬軍之耶和華是他的名。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["耶和華的鐵鎚"]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"text":"你是我爭戰的斧子和打仗的兵器；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要用你打碎列國，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用你毀滅列邦；","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用你打碎馬和騎馬的；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用你打碎戰車和坐在其上的；","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用你打碎男人和女人；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用你打碎老年人和少年人；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用你打碎壯丁和處女；","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用你打碎牧人和他的群畜；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用你打碎農夫和他一對牛；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用你打碎省長和副省長。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"heading","content":["懲罰巴比倫"]},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":["耶和華說：「我必在你們眼前報復巴比倫人和迦勒底居民在錫安所行的諸惡。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":25,"content":[{"text":"耶和華說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你這行毀滅的山哪，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就是毀滅天下的山，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我與你反對。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必向你伸手，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"將你從山巖滾下去，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使你成為燒毀的山。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":26,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"人必不從你那裏取石頭為房角石，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也不取石頭為根基石；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你必永遠荒涼。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是耶和華說的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":27,"content":[{"text":"要在境內豎立大旗，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在各國中吹角，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使列國預備攻擊巴比倫，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"將亞拉臘、米尼、亞實基拿各國招來攻擊她；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又派軍長來攻擊她，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使馬匹上來如螞蚱，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":28,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使列國和米底亞君王，與省長和副省長，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"並他們所管全地之人，都預備攻擊她。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":29,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"地必震動而瘠苦；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因耶和華向巴比倫所定的旨意成立了，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使巴比倫之地荒涼，無人居住。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":30,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"巴比倫的勇士止息爭戰，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"藏在堅壘之中。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們的勇力衰盡，好像婦女一樣。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"巴比倫的住處有火着起，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"門閂都折斷了。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":31,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"跑報的要彼此相遇，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"送信的要互相迎接，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"報告巴比倫王說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"城的四方被攻取了，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":32,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"渡口被佔據了，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"葦塘被火燒了，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"兵丁也驚慌了。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":33,"content":["萬軍之耶和華－以色列的上帝如此說：",{"text":"巴比倫城","poem":1},{"noteId":66},{"text":"好像踹穀的禾場；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"再過片時，收割她的時候就到了。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":34,"content":[{"text":"以色列人說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"巴比倫王尼布甲尼撒吞滅我，壓碎我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使我成為空虛的器皿。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他像大魚將我吞下，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用我的美物充滿他的肚腹，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又將我趕出去。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":35,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"錫安的居民要說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"巴比倫以強暴待我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"損害我的身體，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"願這罪歸給她。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶路撒冷人要說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"願流我們血的罪歸到迦勒底的居民。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["耶和華要幫助以色列"]},{"type":"verse","number":36,"content":[{"text":"所以，耶和華如此說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必為你伸冤，為你報仇；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必使巴比倫的海枯竭，使她的泉源乾涸。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":37,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"巴比倫必成為亂堆，為野狗的住處，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"令人驚駭、嗤笑，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"並且無人居住。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":38,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們要像少壯獅子咆哮，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"像小獅子吼叫。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":39,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們火熱的時候，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必為他們設擺酒席，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使他們沉醉，好叫他們快樂，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"睡了長覺，永不醒起。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是耶和華說的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":40,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必使他們像羊羔、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"像公綿羊和公山羊下到宰殺之地。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["巴比倫的命運"]},{"type":"verse","number":41,"content":[{"text":"示沙克","poem":1},{"noteId":67},{"text":"何竟被攻取？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"天下所稱讚的何竟被佔據？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"巴比倫在列國中何竟變為荒場？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":42,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"海水漲起，漫過巴比倫；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她被許多海浪遮蓋。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":43,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她的城邑變為荒場、旱地、沙漠，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"無人居住，無人經過之地。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":44,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必刑罰巴比倫的彼勒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使他吐出所吞的。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"萬民必不再流歸他那裏；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"巴比倫的城牆也必坍塌了。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":45,"content":[{"text":"我的民哪，你們要從其中出去！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"各人拯救自己，躲避耶和華的烈怒。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":46,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們不要心驚膽怯，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也不要因境內所聽見的風聲懼怕；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為這年有風聲傳來；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那年也有風聲傳來，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"境內有強暴的事，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"官長攻擊官長。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":47,"content":[{"text":"日子將到，我必刑罰巴比倫雕刻的偶像。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她全地必然抱愧；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她被殺的人必在其中仆倒。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":48,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那時，天地和其中所有的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"必因巴比倫歡呼，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為行毀滅的要從北方來到她那裏。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是耶和華說的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":49,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"巴比倫怎樣使以色列被殺的人仆倒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"照樣她全地被殺的人也必在巴比倫仆倒。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["給在巴比倫的以色列人的信息"]},{"type":"verse","number":50,"content":[{"text":"你們躲避刀劍的要快走，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不要站住！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要在遠方記念耶和華，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"心中追想耶路撒冷。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":51,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我們聽見辱罵就蒙羞，滿面慚愧，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為外邦人進入耶和華殿的聖所。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":52,"content":[{"text":"耶和華說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"日子將到，我必刑罰巴比倫雕刻的偶像，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"通國受傷的人必唉哼。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":53,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"巴比倫雖升到天上，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"雖使她堅固的高處更堅固，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"還有行毀滅的從我這裏到她那裏。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是耶和華說的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["巴比倫滅亡"]},{"type":"verse","number":54,"content":[{"text":"有哀號的聲音從巴比倫出來；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"有大毀滅的響聲從迦勒底人之地發出。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":55,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因耶和華使巴比倫變為荒場，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使其中的大聲滅絕。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"仇敵彷彿眾水，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"波浪匉訇，響聲已經發出。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":56,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是行毀滅的臨到巴比倫。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"巴比倫的勇士被捉住，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們的弓折斷了；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為耶和華是施行報應的上帝，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"必定施行報應。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":57,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"君王－名為萬軍之耶和華的說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必使巴比倫的首領、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"智慧人、省長、副省長，和勇士都沉醉，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使他們睡了長覺，永不醒起。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":58,"content":[{"text":"萬軍之耶和華如此說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"巴比倫寬闊的城牆必全然傾倒；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她高大的城門必被火焚燒。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"眾民所勞碌的必致虛空；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"列國所勞碌的被火焚燒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們都必困乏。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["耶利米的信息傳到巴比倫"]},{"type":"verse","number":59,"content":["猶大王西底家在位第四年，上巴比倫去的時候，瑪西雅的孫子、尼利亞的兒子西萊雅與王同去（西萊雅是王宮的大臣），先知耶利米有話吩咐他。"]},{"type":"verse","number":60,"content":["耶利米將一切要臨到巴比倫的災禍，就是論到巴比倫的一切話，寫在書上。"]},{"type":"verse","number":61,"content":["耶利米對西萊雅說：「你到了巴比倫務要念這書上的話；"]},{"type":"verse","number":62,"content":["又說：『耶和華啊，你曾論到這地方說：要剪除，甚至連人帶牲畜沒有在這裏居住的，必永遠荒涼。』"]},{"type":"verse","number":63,"content":["你念完了這書，就把一塊石頭拴在書上，扔在幼發拉底河中，"]},{"type":"verse","number":64,"content":["說：『巴比倫因耶和華所要降與她的災禍，必如此沉下去，不再興起，人民也必困乏。』」",{"text":"耶利米的話到此為止。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":66,"caller":"-","text":"原文是女子","reference":{"chapter":51,"verse":33}},{"noteId":67,"caller":"-","text":"就是巴比倫","reference":{"chapter":51,"verse":41}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/JER/51.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/JER/52.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/JER/50.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":64}